+- HIL test suites: trajectory_following_tests, balance_recovery_tests, contact_injection_tests
+- Waveform capture comparisons vs golden traces and MSE thresholds
+- Performance SLOs: p99 jitter, safe-stop latency, loop frequency stability
+- Evidence: signed HIL bundles, MLflow runs, cosign/Rekor entries
+
