+Production Finalization Checklist (deterministic RT, certification, HW CI, formal, multimodal, carbon)
+
+Follow these steps to move Aegis from scaffold -> operator-validated production:
+
+1) Deterministic RT validation
+ - Run .github/workflows/rt_lab_validation.yml on a self-hosted hardware runner or run ops/robotics/rt/lab_validation/orchestrate_rt_full.sh manually.
+ - Collect signed artifact bundle and upload to auditor.
+ - Ensure p99 jitter and safe-stop SLOs in test_matrix.csv are met.
+
+2) Controller certification
